    (descr "Dailywell 2MD1T1B1M2QES sub-miniature toggle, DPDT ON-ON, PC pin. Sold by Thonk as DW3. Drawn from the manufacturer drawing 2MDP0428 rev C (07.10.2012): P.C. MOUNTING gives two columns 5.08mm apart, three pins per column at 2.54mm, hole dia 1.09mm. Panel hole 4.95mm, bushing 10-48 UNS-2A x 5.59mm. Pins 2 and 5 are the COMMONS; throws are 1/3 and 4/6.")
